nd Capital Resources – Cash Requirements – Significant Capital Projects. Also, see Note 2, Acquisitions, for additional information on the acquisition of Hardin III.", "remarks": ["This is a part of the $2.7 billion to $3.2 billion total common equity we expect to issue through 2029 to finance the capital investment."]}

